\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Human- and LLM-authored realizations of \texttt  {pat\_stomach}, \texttt  {beckon\_come\_here}, and \texttt  {depict\_flying\_bird}. Within each cue, the first two panels show the human- and LLM-authored Humanoid motions, followed by the corresponding Roomba motions. Each panel overlays the trajectory extracted from the rendered clip on its initial frame, while the white box describes the visible action in plain language. The newly authored Roomba \texttt  {pat\_stomach} first turns $-90^\circ $ and then performs four small alternating yaw strokes.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:critical-attributes}{{1}{4}{}{}{}}
